Source: seaweedfs
Section: storage
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SeaweedFS Team <team@seaweedfs.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), golang-go
Standards-Version: 4.6.0

Package: seaweedfs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: SeaweedFS Distributed Object Store and File System
 SeaweedFS is a distributed object storage and file system designed for
 large scale data storage. It features:
  - Distributed hash-based file storage
  - S3-compatible API
  - Filer for POSIX-like access
  - Volume server for actual storage
  - Master server for cluster management
 .
 This package provides the SeaweedFS server binaries.

Package: seaweedfs-master
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, seaweedfs (= ${source:Version})
Description: SeaweedFS Master Server
 The master server manages cluster topology and volume placement.

Package: seaweedfs-volume
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, seaweedfs (= ${source:Version})
Description: SeaweedFS Volume Server
 The volume server handles actual data storage.

Package: seaweedfs-filer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, seaweedfs (= ${source:Version})
Description: SeaweedFS Filer
 The filer provides POSIX-like file system access.

Package: seaweedfs-s3
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, seaweedfs (= ${source:Version})
Description: SeaweedFS S3 API Server
 The S3 gateway provides S3-compatible REST API access.
